---
slug: test/mcp-client-metadata-jwt-only
format: json
---
{%- comment -%}
  TEST FIXTURE (gated): a Client ID Metadata Document for a confidential client — it
  prefers private_key_jwt and does not list "none" among the methods it supports — which
  the built-in authorization server must refuse. Served only when MCP_ENABLE_TEST_TOOLS
  is '1'/'true' (CI + eval hosts).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign test_gate = context.constants.MCP_ENABLE_TEST_TOOLS | default: ''
  if test_gate == '1' or test_gate == 'true'
    function origin = 'modules/mcp/queries/origin'
    assign doc = '{"client_id":"' | append: origin | append: '/test/mcp-client-metadata-jwt-only.json","client_name":"CIMD JWT only","redirect_uris":["https://client-cimd.example.test/cb"],"token_endpoint_auth_method":"private_key_jwt","token_endpoint_auth_methods_supported":["private_key_jwt"]}'
    print doc
  else
    response_status 404
    echo '{}'
  endif
-%}
